@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 180
skinparam sequenceParticipant underline false
skinparam stereotypePosition top
title 3.6.5 Update Cart Item

actor "Cashier" as C
boundary "POS UI" as UI <<boundary>>

== Update cart ==
C -> UI: change qty / kg / remove line
activate UI
UI -> UI: update cart state
UI -> UI: recalc line subtotal = unitPrice * qty * kg
UI -> UI: recalc grand total + payable
UI --> C: show updated totals
deactivate UI

@enduml
